      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I like having it blocked, means there is a small incentive to making optimized avatars, and there is some incentive to talk to VRChat about the performance ranks.\n\nGive this a look, maybe it needs your upvote:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/mobile-alpha/p/desperately-need-a-very-poor-allowance-on-mobile",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
