  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-03-10T12:20:12.140Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So, I have an account on my mobile phone, and I'm unable to view the avatar of my main account (my main account is on Quest 3) due to its performance rating being deemed very poor. When attempting to switch from the fallback to the normal avatar, my phone displays the message 'not compatible with your device.' This appears inaccurate, given that I've successfully rendered more complex 3D models in real-time on my phone. I believe that when choosing to use a less powerfull phone for playing VRChat, users should take responsibility for ensuring optimal performance themselves. If you add more options I don't think, you should alter the default settings.",
